{"id":"u-6ea6ec16-45cb-4669-8149-9aa1ecc40c0b","src":"community","title":"AKTOR LEE’s STRENGTH & HYPERTROPHY TRAINING PLAN","author":"Aktor Lee","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/jEGihy-aktor-lees-strength-and-hypertrophy-training-plan","desc":"12-Week Strength & Hypertrophy Comeback Program\n\nThis 4-day training program is designed for experienced lifters returning to consistent training after a break. The plan combines proven strength-building compound lifts with targeted hypertrophy work to maximize muscle growth while rebuilding foundational strength.\n\nUsing a structured progression system and RPE-based training, you'll gradually increase intensity over 12 weeks, allowing your body to adapt, recover, and perform at its best. The program emphasizes balanced development across all major muscle groups, improved movement quality, and sustainable progress without unnecessary fatigue.\n\nWhat You'll Get:\n\n4 structured training days per week\nStrength-focused compound movements\nHypertrophy-focused accessory work\nProgressive overload framework\nRPE-based intensity management\nBuilt-in recovery and deload strategy\nBalanced muscle development and injury prevention\n\nIdeal For:\nIntermediate and experienced lifters looking to regain strength, rebuild muscle, and establish a strong foundation for long-term progress.\n\nGoal:\nLeave the next 12 weeks stronger, more muscular, and better conditioned than when you started.","level":["Beginner","Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":90,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-06-10T11:01:23.488Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Chest + Triceps + Abs","Back + Biceps + Forearms","Legs + Shoulders","UPPER HYPERTROPHY"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":7,"x":4}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Chest Fly (Machine)","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"V-Handle Tricep Pushdown (Cabl